#: ../../../topics/media-pipeline.rst:831
msgid ""
"This method is called for every item of  :setting:`IMAGES_THUMBS` per "
"downloaded item. It returns the thumbnail download path of the image "
"originating from the specified :class:`response <scrapy.http.Response>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/media-pipeline.rst:835
