"In addition to ``response``, this method receives the original :class:"
"`request <scrapy.Request>`, ``thumb_id``, :class:`info <scrapy.pipelines."
"media.MediaPipeline.SpiderInfo>` and :class:`item <scrapy.Item>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/media-pipeline.rst:841
msgid ""
"You can override this method to customize the thumbnail download path of "
"each image. You can use the ``item`` to determine the file path based on "
"some item property."
